ril, having lived for 50 years\u003C/p>  ",{"id":197,"html":198},"commentary","\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The funerary inscription is Christian, as suggested by the particular attention devoted to recording the day of the deceased's death and by the final Christogram. For the name \u003Cspan class=\"lang\" lang=\"grc\">Ἰουλιανός\u003C/span> in Sicily, see IG XIV 126 (= \u003Ca href=\"https://sicily.classics.ox.ac.uk/inscription/ISic000943\" target=\"_blank\">ISic000943\u003C/a>), from Syracuse.\u003C/p>  ",{"id":200,"html":201},"bibliography","\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Amico 1741 267 no. IX \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002186\u003C/a>  \u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kirchhoff 1877 9489 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001249\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Kaibel 1890 \u003Ca href=\"https://clio.columbia.edu/catalog/6873760\" target=\"_blank\">539\u003C/a>  \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001072\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  ",{"id":203,"html":204},"license"," Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  ",[206,208,211,212],{"html":207},"Text encoding: Alex Antoniou",{"id":209,"lang":89,"html":210},"edition-interpretive","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ἐτελεύτησεν\">ἐτελεύτησεν\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰουλιανὸς\">Ἰουλιανὸς\u003C/span>\u00